{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとか最終日までに\n3月のライオンコラボメニューを\n食べに行くことができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間は売り切れてたからリベンジ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘やかしうどんも食べられて\nおいなりさんもゲット！\n食べていて美味しいのはもちろんだけど\nなにより幸せな気持ちになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘やかしうどんは開店とともに\n行列が出来ていて\n3月のライオンの人気の高さを\n感じました( ^ω^ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の日曜10月2日の将棋フォーカスは\nNHKにて放送されます\nアニメ「3月のライオン」の特集です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストに岡本信彦さんをお呼びして\nいろいろとお話を伺いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岡本さんはアマ3段の棋力をお持ちで、\nお話を聞いていて\nとっても楽しかったです☻！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくなかった個握や\n久しぶりの名古屋全握が\nバタバタと終わってしまいました...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログに書けていなかったね、\nごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋全握の時のです☻\n最終的には\nひめ×ゆっちゃん×私の\n3人レーンになって\nわちゃわちゃと楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握は予告通り\n季節外れの浴衣を着ました( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2枚着たんだけど\nみんなが変化に気付きやすいように\nツモリのポップな浴衣と\n深緑の和な浴衣にしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい列長かったのは嬉しかったけど\n待たせてしまってごめんなさい(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日から16th受付です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"釣りとか甘いのは不得意だけど\n会話のテンポ、お友達感覚\n盛り上がりはお約束します( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしています☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎どこかのMCで隣のまいちゅんとイチャイチャしてて、そういうのを見れるのもライブの醍醐味だなって思った(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→かなちゃんが\n「かき氷の片想いは二期生の曲で若い子達がああいう曲を歌うのはすごく良い」\nって話をしていた時ですね(笑)私たちは\nその話に突っ込むべきか否か\n緊急会議をしていました(*_*)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/09/30/0822854/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都三日間楽しみです( ^ω^ )\nよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}